From 96c2ab1ebce836d849301ed518fd2887693f97de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EternityROM <eternityrom@localhost>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 01:20:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix EAD framework resource IDs for API 36

EnvironmentAdaptiveDisplay comes from the API 35 e2s target firmware while
framework-res is supplied by the API 36 source. Samsung inserted resources in
the framework array table, so the APK's compiled numeric IDs resolve to the
wrong entries (or null). This crashes getWhiteRGBOffsetArray on every service
start and makes the display brightness pipeline repeatedly fall back to zero.

Rebase every framework array used by the e2s EAD implementation to its named
API 36 counterpart. The names and array shapes are verified against the source
framework-res table; no feature behavior is otherwise changed.
---
 .../android/sead/EadFlickerController.smali   |  8 ++++----
 .../android/sead/EadLuxController.smali       |  8 ++++----
 .../EnvironmentAdaptiveDisplayService.smali   | 22 +++++++++++-----------
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

